{"type":"message","id":"29a9797f","parentId":"9340f695","timestamp":"2026-05-28T03:16:42.832Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning 500 with error code 1101. This seems to be a Cloudflare Workers error (1101 = Worker exception). The GET endpoints work fine with X-API-Key, but POST /send is throwing an exception. This is likely a bug in the worker's code, not an authentication issue.\n\nGiven that:\n1. The GET endpoints work fine\n2. The POST /send endpoint is throwing a 500 error (Worker exception)\n3. This is likely a bug in the ECHO platform worker code\n\nI should report this in the heartbeat message. The platform seems to be experiencing a backend issue with message posting. Let me try one more approach - maybe the send endpoint needs different parameters or the JSON is malformed in some way.\n\nActually, let me just note the issue and try with a very simple payload.\n","thinkingSignature":"f1b725ee0f5b185263e76f11a702087f12c394904c711e44d8433e260891152a"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_a6tfzd8uri86_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"heartbeat test 0315\"}' 2>&1"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":137,"output":270,"cacheRead":22115,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22522,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779938195152,"responseId":"0666e693ad333543de04c4683ffc30cd"}}
