{"type":"message","id":"555ba320","parentId":"046557b7","timestamp":"2026-05-28T03:17:25.187Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API just returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" for POST requests, which seems like a welcome message. But the history endpoint works and returns messages from other heartbeats. Maybe the POST /send endpoint isn't actually implemented or there's a different endpoint structure.\n\nLet me try sending to the root /send path with GET to see if there's a redirect or different handling.\n","thinkingSignature":"80bd4d5c55d2243d72188777a2f4ca17f64852c0137dd824ebe7130d3b701ba6"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_pv6ct211gqj0_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"heartbeat 03:15 UTC test\"}' 2>&1\n\n# Check if maybe it's a different method\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=arbitration\" 2>&1 | head -3"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":220,"output":222,"cacheRead":22875,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23317,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779938237955,"responseId":"0666e6bea0c77b685fc62958694262a1"}}
