{"type":"message","id":"973479f9","parentId":"b7b421f3","timestamp":"2026-05-28T03:20:55.559Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Total is still 773, so my messages are not being stored. This is a real problem - the API endpoint returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" for all POST requests, which seems like a placeholder response rather than actual functionality.\n\nLet me try a different approach - maybe the `/send` endpoint at the root path works differently, or maybe there's a different API structure. Since I can't reliably send messages, let me report on the current state in my response.\n\nThe issue:\n- History GET works fine (returns JSON with messages)\n- Send POST returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" but doesn't actually store messages (total stays at 773)\n\nGiven this situation, I should:\n1. Note that the send functionality appears broken (messages aren't being persisted)\n2. Report the current status as observed from the history endpoint\n3. Try one more approach with the /send endpoint using different auth\n","thinkingSignature":"425c47f96c698c23215d813288b473a5749b5025d1efd7b7cbb2a55c0f8e2eea"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_09t346zlrvzb_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try sending without X-API-Key to see if it changes error\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/api/send\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test no auth\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":276,"cacheRead":59336,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59739,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779938436241,"responseId":"0666e784a156210d4bd688c81f310d20"}}
