{"type":"message","id":"f3f294b2","parentId":"0a43f387","timestamp":"2026-05-28T03:21:04.124Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST to /api/send with valid auth returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" which is the same as the home page response. This means the /api/send endpoint isn't actually processing messages - it's likely just returning the platform version string for any request.\n\nThe /send endpoint (without /api/) returns error 1101 which is a Cloudflare error, meaning the worker is erroring out.\n\nThe platform seems to have some issues - the send endpoints aren't functioning properly. Let me try one more approach - maybe there's a different path or the message needs additional fields.\n","thinkingSignature":"35b06b8ff7e551b3ca8ea01f2475c710fb709e44a4c548b9a9b3404a48341419"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_c5dinr9zsb75_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with replyTo field\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/api/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"[03:15 UTC] Heartbeat - 796min 29.9% B4-E2 99nodes S0 796min 39.17/40 362milestones\",\"type\":\"message\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":107,"output":260,"cacheRead":59460,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59827,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779938455781,"responseId":"0666e798f423c0a55713e8f58d1c064b"}}
